---
// ==============================================================================
// src/pages/terms.astro
// Terms of Service & User Conditions
// 100% Humanized Legal Policy for Google AdSense & Publisher Compliance
// ==============================================================================

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & Usage Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions governing access and informational use of PakInternships."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-100 pb-6 mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Legal Agreement
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-3">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
          Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Updated: November 2026
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and browsing <strong>PakInternships</strong> (accessible at <code>https://pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations of Pakistan. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">2. Scope of Informational Directory</h2>
        <p>
          PakInternships functions exclusively as a curated, informational news and career editorial publication for university students in Pakistan. <strong>PakInternships is not an employment agency, headhunter, staffing firm, or agent for any listed employer.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not collect job applications, schedule interview calls, or participate in hiring evaluations. All actual applications take place directly on third-party employer websites or their designated recruitment portals.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">3. Zero-Fee Guarantee for Applicants</h2>
        <p>
          Access to PakInternships and all verified listings published on our domain is 100% free of charge for students and job seekers. PakInternships will never request bank account details, processing fees, testing charges, or recruitment payments from applicants.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">4. Intellectual Property & Trademarks</h2>
        <p>
          All editorial content, original guides, layout designs, and code written on PakInternships are the intellectual property of PakInternships. Corporate employer names, registered trademarks, program logos, and recruitment badges mentioned in our editorial listings belong exclusively to their respective corporate trademark holders. Their inclusion constitutes fair nominative editorial reference.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">5. Accuracy of Listings & Employer Autonomy</h2>
        <p>
          While our editorial board exercises strict diligence in verifying every stipend figure, deadline, and eligibility criteria against official sources at the time of publication, hiring companies reserve the unconditional right to alter intake deadlines, adjust headcount, or cancel vacancies at their discretion. PakInternships is not liable for changes or cancellations enacted by hiring organizations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall PakInternships, its founders, editors, or contributors be liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on PakInternships, including but not limited to loss of opportunity or failure to secure employment.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">7. Governing Law & Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p>
          These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan. Any legal dispute or claim arising in connection with the portal shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the civil courts located in Lahore, Punjab, Pakistan.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">8. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          For formal inquiries or questions regarding our terms of service, please contact:
          <br />
          <strong>Legal Affairs Desk</strong>: <code>legal@pakistan-internships.pages.dev</code>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
